# Homelab Infrastructure

NixOS-based homelab infrastructure running on Proxmox VE, managed with Nix flakes.

## Directory Structure

```
.
├── beads/           # AI context files (Claude instructions, project docs)
├── hosts/
│   ├── lxc/         # LXC container configurations
│   └── proxmox/     # Proxmox VE host configurations
├── lib/             # Shared Nix library functions
├── modules/         # NixOS modules
├── secrets/         # Encrypted secrets (sops-nix)
└── flake.nix        # Flake entrypoint
```

## Key Features

- **LXC Containers**: NixOS containers managed via Proxmox
- **Sidecar Pattern**: Shared services (backup, healthchecks) injected into containers
- **Secrets Management**: Encrypted with sops-nix and age
- **Reverse Proxy**: Caddy with automatic HTTPS
- **Media Stack**: Plex, *arr apps, Deluge
- **Security**: CrowdSec for intrusion detection

## Quick Start

```bash
# Enter dev shell
nix develop

# Deploy a container
nixos-rebuild switch --flake .#container-name --target-host root@container-ip

# Edit secrets
sops secrets/secrets.yaml
```

## Documentation

- [Hosts README](hosts/README.md) - Container and host details
- [Modules README](modules/README.md) - Custom NixOS modules
- [Secrets README](secrets/README.md) - Secrets management
- [Beads](beads/README.md) - AI assistant context
